# Public TLS terminator for the learner API (U2). Caddy auto-provisions a Let's Encrypt
# certificate for this hostname (A record → VPS IP) and reverse-proxies to the learner-api
# container over the internal `lrnki` network. Caddy overwrites any incoming X-Forwarded-For
# with the real client IP by default, so the session rate limiter's first-XFF read is not
# spoofable — no application change needed.
api.lrnki.globesoul.com {
	reverse_proxy learner-api:8787
}
